<title>UK: Credit Local sets 2.0 billion Lux franc bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 2.0 billion Lux franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Internationale de Luxembourg and Credit Communal/Gemeentekredit.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    29.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.30    PAY DATE  L-29.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 5.76 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    =	   SELL CONC  =	   PRAECIPUUM  0.25</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
